      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "t-069",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 738,
      "width": 833.2800000000001,
      "height": 120.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1118706723,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1803782208,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Boundaries (CLAUDE.md \u00a73)\n\u2022 One clock domain; slow timing only via clock enables.\n\u2022 Every pad input is synchronized exactly once (pe_host_spi / pe_pins).\n\u2022 Protocol behavior lives in firmware; the only fixed protocol block is the SPI-slave loader.\n\u2022 Program memory is written only by the loader, and only while the engine is halted.\n\u2022 Reset: engine halted, all uio_oe = 0. Open-drain pins never drive 1.",
      "originalText": "Boundaries (CLAUDE.md \u00a73)\n\u2022 One clock domain; slow timing only via clock enables.\n\u2022 Every pad input is synchronized exactly once (pe_host_spi / pe_pins).\n\u2022 Protocol behavior lives in firmware; the only fixed protocol block is the SPI-slave loader.\n\u2022 Program memory is written only by the loader, and only while the engine is halted.\n\u2022 Reset: engine halted, all uio_oe = 0. Open-drain pins never drive 1.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "note-068",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
